OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fwill gradually die out this evening.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,8,Facross all parts with clear periods.
OL,9,FBecoming chilly across Deeside.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA dry morning with sunny
OL,12,Fspells. Becoming cloudier in the
OL,13,Fafternoon with a few light showers,
OL,14,Fthese mainly in the west and north.
OL,15,FDrier and brighter again in the
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMainly
OL,19,Fdry and bright on Sunday. Becoming
OL,20,Funsettled on Monday and Tuesday,
OL,21,Fperhaps heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
